        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yoshua aebele Akani ati, “Kanshi cinshi ico iwe uletele ubusanso ubushaibipila pali ifwe? Yawe nao nomba alakuletela ubusanso ilelo linefye.” Elyo bonse abena Israeli bamutobele amabwe. Kabili panuma yakubatobaula amabwe, baboca na mu mulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
